[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21909.51, "timestamp": "06:05:09", "text": "是啊，那真不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21911.99, "timestamp": "06:05:11", "text": "为家人和朋友烹饪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21915.51, "timestamp": "06:05:15", "text": "大家围坐在餐桌旁一起用餐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21918.47, "timestamp": "06:05:18", "text": "很有趣。就像……他们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21920.548, "timestamp": "06:05:20", "text": "告诉我他们想要什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21923.75, "timestamp": "06:05:23", "text": "或者看看。呃，他们看到我尝试做某事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21925.35, "timestamp": "06:05:25", "text": "然后我就会说，“好吧，我只是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21927.35, "timestamp": "06:05:27", "text": "我打算试试。如果结果并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21929.27, "timestamp": "06:05:29", "text": "那太好了，你也得吃掉它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21931.83, "timestamp": "06:05:31", "text": "方式。” 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21935.35, "timestamp": "06:05:35", "text": "所以，谢天谢地，目前还没有发生过这种情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21937.83, "timestamp": "06:05:37", "text": "这算不上什么重大失败，因为即便它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21941.27, "timestamp": "06:05:41", "text": "与我想象或预期的不一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21944.62, "timestamp": "06:05:44", "text": "但不知为何，它竟然还能入口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21946.23, "timestamp": "06:05:46", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21949.27, "timestamp": "06:05:49", "text": "我记得我曾经尝试过苹果之类的产品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21951.03, "timestamp": "06:05:51", "text": "还有奶酪给我弟弟，因为他想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21953.27, "timestamp": "06:05:53", "text": "我试了一下，然后我就想，我从来没有过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21955.99, "timestamp": "06:05:55", "text": "虽然成功了，但你知道吗，我还是即兴发挥吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21958.39, "timestamp": "06:05:58", "text": "它。"}]